  "title": "The psychology of tipping online: how small gestures change creators’ lives",
  "summary": "You’ve watched their videos for free. You’ve laughed at their jokes, learned from their tutorials, and been comforted by their voice during lonely drives. You’ve consumed hours of their work without paying a cent. And that’s completely fine. That’s how the internet works. But here’s what most people don’t realize. That $5 you could send […]",
